<main id="main-content" class="content-page">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><span>Cookie Policy</span></nav>
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>

    <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. Alongside browser local storage, they help the site remember your preferences and improve your experience. This site uses both.</p>

    <h2>Cookies We Use</h2>

    <h3>Essential Cookies &amp; Local Storage</h3>
    <p>These are required for the game to function and store small preferences on your own device.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Nickname &amp; player ID</strong> — Remembers your display name and lets you reconnect to a game in progress.</li>
      <li><strong>Preferences</strong> — Stores local choices such as your card style, sound setting, and (when signed out) your coins and cosmetics, kept in your browser's local storage.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Advertising Cookies</h3>
    <p>These are set by Google to display advertisements. When you use the site, Google and its partners may place and read cookies to serve and measure ads.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>__gads / Google ad cookies</strong> — Used by Google AdSense to serve ads and limit how often you see the same ad (up to ~13-month expiry).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can control ad personalization in your <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ad Settings</a>. Where required by law (for example, for visitors in the EEA and UK), ad and consent choices are handled through Google's consent management tools.</p>

    <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p>You can clear or block cookies at any time through your browser settings, and manage ad personalization via <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ad Settings</a>. Blocking essential cookies or local storage may prevent the game from working correctly.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about our cookie practices, email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
  </div>
</main>
